Hina's Drift Club - Honda S2000 AP1

The club's precision roadster. A fictional approximately 330 hp naturally aspirated tune keeps the AP1's high-revving character and six-speed manual, while independent Hina's Drifters S2000 tyres and a progressive mechanical limited-slip differential support linked slides. The Special Edition Suzuka Blue appearance includes the native front splitter, hard top and decklid spoiler; customization, animations and the damage system are retained.

Use engine speed and small, deliberate throttle changes to adjust your line. A smoother pedal curve and softened overrun are intended to make mid-drift correction more readable, while the compact chassis rewards accurate transitions. Start with the default setup. This is an HDC game tune, not a stock Honda specification or a validated real-world build.
